Interactability_Text_Line_0 Log 15/5/17 - Research Outpost: Alpha
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ------
Interactability_Text_Line_2 During one of our research vessel’s scouting missions of the ocean floor around the island, we noticed a large chasm had opened up underwater off the south eastern shore. We’ll let HQ know about this new discovery and find out if it’s useful to us. 